JÉSSICA OSORIO OLIVA:
Hi, I'm Jéssica Osorio.

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:09.780
I'm a journalist and communication
specialist from Guatemala.

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:13.380
I have completed the course, Remote
Work Revolution for Everyone.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:16.680
The course made a very
interesting professional turn

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:18.540
for me and my professional team.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:21.930
I have been working
remotely the last six years

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:25.020
but the knowledge that I got
through this Harvard Online course

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:27.840
allowed me to organize my
time based on my well-being

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:30.990
to reduce the possibility
of making mistakes.

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:33.090
The reason why I tried to
complete the certificate

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:36.900
and finally be part of the Harvard
global community of learners

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:40.170
was that I needed improve my
skills, and because of the pride

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:43.650
of having the support of one of
the best universities in the world.

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:44.980
Thank you, Harvard Online.

